{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"cart_hand","model_identifier":"cart_hand","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## cart_hand\n\nHand cart (E5).\n\n- Cubes: 24 (6 rotated). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -14.5..14.5, y 0.0..28.8, z -20.0..30.5 (size 29.0 x 28.8 x 50.5 u = 82 x 81 x 142 cm).\nHand cart: a small two-wheeled plank handcart a worker pushes (1.4 m = 50 u long including the handles, 29 u wide), solid plank wheels (0.6 m), low plank sides with a hinged tailboard, two long handles with leather grips and two rest legs at the back; team-colour stripe on both sides. Faces -Z (it is pushed forward, the worker behind at +Z).\n\n**Hit box:** one box 29 x 22 x 50 u, from y = 0, centred x = 0, z = 5.\n\n**Bones:** `root` > `bed` (pivot on the axle: everything but the wheels; pitch it to lift the handles) > `tailboard` (hinge at the back of the floor); `wheel_r`, `wheel_l` (axle pivots).\n\n**Slots:** `slot_grip_r` / `slot_grip_l` at the handle grips (27.7 u up, 28.5 u behind the origin, 16 u apart) for the pusher's hands; `slot_hitch` midway between them (same point the game uses for hauling); `slot_crew_1` = the pusher's feet (0, 0, 39) facing -Z; `slot_crew_2` beside the cart on the left; `slot_cargo` on the floor centre (D6 loads sit here, their origin on the floor).\n\n**Move speed:** `move` designed for 35.6 u/s (1.0 m/s, a worker walking): one wheel turn per 1.85 s (circumference 66.0 u). During `move` the bed is tipped 8.4 deg so the legs clear the ground (handles lifted ~2 u, into the pusher's walking hand height).\n\n**Key times:** `use` (dump) 2.0 s: the handles go up, the cart tips forward 28 deg and the tailboard swings open; key 0.8 s (load slides out). `idle` = parked on its legs (the tailboard creaks). `damaged` 0.6 s rattle, the right wheel wobbles. `destroyed` holds: the right wheel breaks off flat, the cart falls onto its right side, the tailboard hangs open.\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop |\n|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |\n| `move` | 1.853 | loop |\n| `use` | 2 | once |\n| `damaged` | 0.6 | once |\n| `destroyed` | 1.6 | hold |\n"},"description":"## cart_hand\n\nHand cart (E5).\n\n- Cubes: 24 (6 rotated). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -14.5..14.5, y 0.0..28.8, z -20.0..30.5 (size 29.0 x 28.8 x 50.5 u = 82 x 81 x 142 cm).\nHand cart: a small two-wheeled plank handcart a worker pushes (1.4 m = 50 u long including the handles, 29 u wide), solid plank wheels (0.6 m), low plank sides with a hinged tailboard, two long handles with leather grips and two rest legs at the back; team-colour stripe on both sides. Faces -Z (it is pushed forward, the worker behind at +Z).\n\n**Hit box:** one box 29 x 22 x 50 u, from y = 0, centred x = 0, z = 5.\n\n**Bones:** `root` > `bed` (pivot on the axle: everything but the wheels; pitch it to lift the handles) > `tailboard` (hinge at the back of the floor); `wheel_r`, `wheel_l` (axle pivots).\n\n**Slots:** `slot_grip_r` / `slot_grip_l` at the handle grips (27.7 u up, 28.5 u behind the origin, 16 u apart) for the pusher's hands; `slot_hitch` midway between them (same point the game uses for hauling); `slot_crew_1` = the pusher's feet (0, 0, 39) facing -Z; `slot_crew_2` beside the cart on the left; `slot_cargo` on the floor centre (D6 loads sit here, their origin on the floor).\n\n**Move speed:** `move` designed for 35.6 u/s (1.0 m/s, a worker walking): one wheel turn per 1.85 s (circumference 66.0 u). During `move` the bed is tipped 8.4 deg so the legs clear the ground (handles lifted ~2 u, into the pusher's walking hand height).\n\n**Key times:** `use` (dump) 2.0 s: the handles go up, the cart tips forward 28 deg and the tailboard swings open; key 0.8 s (load slides out). `idle` = parked on its legs (the tailboard creaks). `damaged` 0.6 s rattle, the right wheel wobbles. `destroyed` holds: the right wheel breaks off flat, the cart falls onto its right side, the tailboard hangs open.\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop |\n|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |\n| `move` | 1.853 | loop |\n| `use` | 2 | once |\n| `damaged` | 0.6 | once |\n| `destroyed` | 1.6 | hold |\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"floor","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-10.0,13.0,-20.0],"to":[10.0,15.0,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,10.5,-6.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,91,44.0,93.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,85,34.0,87.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[44,91,64.0,93.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[34,85,68.0,87.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,20.0,34.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20,0,40.0,34.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d3c49d25-b4af-5d3f-881e-08bbdb6362d1"},{"name":"side_r","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[9.0,15.0,-20.0],"to":[10.5,21.0,14.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,10.5,-6.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18,79,19.5,85.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[48,64,82.0,70.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20,79,21.5,85.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[82,64,116.0,70.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[40,0,41.5,34.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[42,0,43.5,34.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"caf3a0b2-1abe-5ad6-bc16-db5ae8e3327a"},{"name":"handle_r","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[7.1,17.0,6.0],"to":[8.9,18.8,30.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[8,17.9,6],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18,93,19.8,94.8],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[52,89,76.0,90.8],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20,93,21.8,94.8],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[76,89,100.0,90.8],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[52,0,53.8,24.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[54,0,55.8,24.0],"t